#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:348
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The exact device names will vary depending on the disk layout and "
"partitioning scheme.  It is strongly recommended to record the provider "
"names during installation, as they will be required during journal "
"configuration."
msgstr "确切的设备名称会因磁盘布局和分区方案而异。强烈建议在安装时记录提供者名称，因为配置日志时需要用到这些名称。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:349
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Journal Size Considerations"
msgstr "日志大小注意事项"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:354
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Journal size depends on the expected write workload rather than on the size "
"of the file system.  For general-purpose systems, journal sizes of 1–2 GB "
"are commonly sufficient.  Systems with sustained or bursty write activity "
"may require larger journals."
msgstr "日志大小取决于预期写入负载，而不是文件系统的大小。对于通用系统，1–2 GB 的日志通常足够。持续或突发写入活动的系统可能需要更大的日志。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:356
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Allocate journal space conservatively during installation, as resizing "
"partitions later may require additional downtime."
msgstr "安装时应谨慎分配日志空间，因为之后调整分区大小可能需要额外停机时间。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:357
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Completing the Installation"
msgstr "完成安装"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:361
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After reserving the required partitions, complete the FreeBSD installation "
"normally.  It is recommended to postpone the installation of third-party "
"software and additional system configuration until GEOM journaling has been "
"fully configured."
msgstr "预留所需分区后，按常规完成 FreeBSD 安装。建议暂缓安装第三方软件和进行其他系统配置，直到 GEOM 日志完成全部配置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:364
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"At this stage, the system will boot using the standard UFS file systems.  "
"The reserved journal partitions will remain unused until journaling is "
"explicitly enabled."
msgstr "此时，系统将使用标准 UFS 文件系统启动。预留的日志分区在明确启用日志之前将保持未使用状态。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:366
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "First Boot After Installation"
msgstr "安装后的首次启动"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:370
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After the first successful boot, no immediate configuration changes are "
"required.  The system should be verified to boot and operate normally before "
"proceeding."
msgstr "首次成功启动后，无需立即更改配置。继续操作前，应确认系统能够正常启动和运行。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:372
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the base system is confirmed to be functional, the next steps involve:"
msgstr "确认基本系统正常运行后，接下来需要："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:374
#, fuzzy
msgid "Loading or enabling GEOM journaling support"
msgstr "加载或启用 GEOM 日志支持"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:375
#, fuzzy
msgid "Associating journal providers with their corresponding data providers"
msgstr "将日志提供者与相应的数据提供者关联"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:376
#, fuzzy
msgid "Updating `/etc/fstab` to mount the journaled devices"
msgstr "更新 `/etc/fstab`，以挂载启用了日志的设备"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:378
#, fuzzy
msgid "These steps are described in the following section."
msgstr "这些步骤将在下一节中介绍。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:380
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Setting Up Journaling"
msgstr "设置日志"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:383
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Enabling GEOM Journaling on Existing File Systems"
msgstr "在现有文件系统上启用 GEOM 日志"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:386
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section describes how to enable GEOM journaling on the `/usr` and `/"
"var` file systems using the partitions prepared during installation."
msgstr "本节介绍如何使用安装期间准备的分区，在 `/usr` 和 `/var` 文件系统上启用 GEOM 日志。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:389
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the required journal providers have been reserved, GEOM journaling can "
"be configured.  Because the file systems to be journaled must not be "
"mounted, the system must be switched to single-user mode."
msgstr "预留所需的日志提供者后，即可配置 GEOM 日志。由于要启用日志的文件系统必须处于未挂载状态，因此必须将系统切换到单用户模式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:391
#, fuzzy
msgid "Log in as `root` and enter:"
msgstr "以 `root` 身份登录并输入："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:395
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:718
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# shutdown now\n"
msgstr "# shutdown now\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:400
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Press kbd:[Enter] to obtain a root shell.  Unmount the file systems that "
"will be journaled.  In this example, `/usr` and `/var`:"
msgstr "按 kbd:[Enter] 进入 root shell。卸载要启用日志的文件系统。本例中为 `/usr` 和 `/var`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:404
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:725
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# umount /usr /var\n"
msgstr "# umount /usr /var\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:407
#, fuzzy
msgid "Load the GEOM journaling kernel module:"
msgstr "加载 GEOM 日志内核模块："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:411
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:690
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# gjournal load\n"
msgstr "# gjournal load\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:415
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Next, associate each data provider with its corresponding journal provider.  "
"Use your notes to determine which partition will be used for each journal."
msgstr "接下来，将每个数据提供者与相应的日志提供者关联。根据记录确定每个日志所用的分区。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:417
#, fuzzy
msgid "In this example:"
msgstr "在本例中："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:419
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`/usr` resides on `/dev/ada0p3` and its journal provider is `/dev/ada0p5`"
msgstr "`/usr` 位于 `/dev/ada0p3`，其日志提供者为 `/dev/ada0p5`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:420
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`/var` resides on `/dev/ada0p2` and its journal provider is `/dev/ada0p4`"
msgstr "`/var` 位于 `/dev/ada0p2`，其日志提供者为 `/dev/ada0p4`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:422
#, fuzzy
msgid "Create the journaled providers using `gjournal(8)`:"
msgstr "使用 `gjournal(8)` 创建启用了日志的提供者："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:429
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# gjournal label ada0p3 ada0p5\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 2948326772: ada0p5 contains journal.\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 2948326772: ada0p3 contains data.\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p3 clean.\n"
msgstr "# gjournal label ada0p3 ada0p5\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 2948326772: ada0p5 contains journal.\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 2948326772: ada0p3 contains data.\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p3 clean.\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:434
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# gjournal label ada0p2 ada0p4\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 3193218002: ada0p4 contains journal.\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 3193218002: ada0p2 contains data.\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p2 clean.\n"
msgstr "# gjournal label ada0p2 ada0p4\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 3193218002: ada0p4 contains journal.\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 3193218002: ada0p2 contains data.\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p2 clean.\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:441
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If `gjournal` reports that the last sector of a provider is in use, the "
"command will fail.  On freshly created or unused partitions, it is safe to "
"retry the operation with the `-f` flag to force initialization:"
msgstr "如果 `gjournal` 报告某个提供者的最后一个扇区正在使用，该命令将失败。对于新建或未使用的分区，可以安全地使用 `-f` 标志强制初始化并重试："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:445
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# gjournal label -f /dev/ada0p2 /dev/ada0p4\n"
msgstr "# gjournal label -f /dev/ada0p2 /dev/ada0p4\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:449
#, fuzzy
msgid "After labeling, two new journaled providers are created:"
msgstr "添加标签后，将创建两个新的日志提供者："

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:451
#, fuzzy
msgid "`/dev/ada0p3.journal` for `/usr`"
msgstr "`/usr` 使用 `/dev/ada0p3.journal`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:452
#, fuzzy
msgid "`/dev/ada0p2.journal` for `/var`"
msgstr "`/var` 使用 `/dev/ada0p2.journal`"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:454
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These devices will replace the original data providers when mounting the "
"file systems."
msgstr "挂载文件系统时，这些设备将取代原始数据提供者。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:456
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Before mounting, we must however set the journal flag on them and clear the "
"Soft Updates flag:"
msgstr "不过，在挂载之前，我们必须为这些设备设置日志标志并清除 Soft Updates 标志："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:464
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# tunefs -J enable -n disable -j disable /dev/ada0p3.journal\n"
"tunefs: soft updates journaling cleared but soft updates still set\n"
"tunefs: remove .sujournal to reclaim space\n"
"tunefs: gjournal set\n"
"tunefs: soft updates cleared\n"
msgstr "# tunefs -J enable -n disable -j disable /dev/ada0p3.journal\ntunefs: soft updates journaling cleared but soft updates still set\ntunefs: remove .sujournal to reclaim space\ntunefs: gjournal set\ntunefs: soft updates cleared\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:470
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# tunefs -J enable -n disable -j disable /dev/ada0p2.journal\n"
"tunefs: soft updates journaling cleared but soft updates still set\n"
"tunefs: remove .sujournal to reclaim space\n"
"tunefs: gjournal set\n"
"tunefs: soft updates cleared\n"
msgstr "# tunefs -J enable -n disable -j disable /dev/ada0p2.journal\ntunefs: soft updates journaling cleared but soft updates still set\ntunefs: remove .sujournal to reclaim space\ntunefs: gjournal set\ntunefs: soft updates cleared\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:473
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now, mount the new devices manually at their respective places to verify "
"correct operation (note that we can now use the `async` mount option) and "
"remove [.filename]#.sujournal# to reclaim space:"
msgstr "现在，手动将新设备挂载到各自的位置，以验证其运行是否正常（注意，现在可以使用 `async` 挂载选项），并删除 [.filename]#.sujournal# 以回收空间："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:480
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# mount -o async /dev/ada0p2.journal /var\n"
"# rm /var/.sujournal\n"
"# mount -o async /dev/ada0p3.journal /usr\n"
"# rm /usr/.sujournal\n"
msgstr "# mount -o async /dev/ada0p2.journal /var\n# rm /var/.sujournal\n# mount -o async /dev/ada0p3.journal /usr\n# rm /usr/.sujournal\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:483
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Edit [.filename]#/etc/fstab# and update the entries for [.filename]#/usr# "
"and [.filename]#/var#:"
msgstr "编辑 [.filename]#/etc/fstab#，并更新 [.filename]#/usr# 和 [.filename]#/var# 的条目："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:488
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"/dev/ada0p3.journal    /usr    ufs     rw,async      2       2\n"
"/dev/ada0p2.journal    /var    ufs     rw,async      2       2\n"
msgstr "/dev/ada0p3.journal    /usr    ufs     rw,async      2       2\n/dev/ada0p2.journal    /var    ufs     rw,async      2       2\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:493
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make sure the above entries are correct, or you will have trouble starting "
"up normally after you reboot!"
msgstr "请确保上述条目正确，否则重启后可能无法正常启动！"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:496
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Finally, edit [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# and add the following line so "
"the man:gjournal[8] module is loaded at every boot:"
msgstr "最后，编辑 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# 并添加以下行，以便在每次启动时加载 man:gjournal[8] 模块："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:500
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:682
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:816
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "geom_journal_load=\"YES\"\n"
msgstr "geom_journal_load=\"YES\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:504
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Congratulations! Your system is now set for journaling.  You can either type "
"`exit` to return to multi-user mode, or reboot to test your configuration "
"(recommended)."
msgstr "恭喜！系统现已配置为使用日志。可以输入 `exit` 返回多用户模式，也可以重启以测试配置（推荐）。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:508
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:762
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# shutdown -r now\n"
msgstr "# shutdown -r now\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:511
#, fuzzy
msgid "During the boot you will see messages like the following:"
msgstr "启动过程中会看到类似以下的消息："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:521
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# dmesg | grep GEOM_JOURNAL\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 2948326772: ada0p4 contains journal.\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 3193218002: ada0p5 contains journal.\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 2948326772: ada0p2 contains data.\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p2 clean.\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 3193218002: ada0p3 contains data.\n"
"GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p3 clean.\n"
msgstr "# dmesg | grep GEOM_JOURNAL\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 2948326772: ada0p4 contains journal.\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 3193218002: ada0p5 contains journal.\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 2948326772: ada0p2 contains data.\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p2 clean.\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal 3193218002: ada0p3 contains data.\nGEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p3 clean.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:524
#, fuzzy
msgid "After an unclean shutdown, the messages will vary slightly, i.e.:"
msgstr "非正常关机后，消息会略有不同，例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:528
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p2 consistent.\n"
msgstr "GEOM_JOURNAL: Journal ada0p2 consistent.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:531
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This usually means that man:gjournal[8] used the information in the journal "
"provider to return the file system to a consistent state."
msgstr "这通常意味着 man:gjournal[8] 使用日志提供者中的信息，将文件系统恢复到了一个一致的状态。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:533
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Enabling GEOM Journaling on Newly Created Partitions"
msgstr "在新建分区上启用 GEOM 日志"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:537
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The procedure described earlier is required when enabling GEOM journaling on "
"file systems that already contain data.  When journaling a newly created, "
"empty partition, the process is simpler because both the data and journal "
"providers can reside within the same partition."
msgstr "在已包含数据的文件系统上启用 GEOM 日志时，需要执行前面介绍的步骤。对于新建的空分区，过程更简单，因为数据提供者和日志提供者可以位于同一个分区中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:539
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This approach is typically used for new disks or newly allocated partitions "
"that have not yet been formatted with a file system."
msgstr "这种方法通常用于尚未格式化文件系统的新磁盘或新分配的分区。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:544
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While the above procedure is necessary for journaling partitions that "
"already contain data, journaling an empty partition is somewhat easier, "
"since both the data and the journal provider can be stored in the same "
"partition.  For example, assume a new disk was installed, and a new "
"partition [.filename]#/dev/ada1p1# was created.  Creating the journal would "
"be as simple as:"
msgstr "对于已经包含数据的分区，必须执行上述步骤才能启用日志记录；而为空分区启用日志记录要简单一些，因为数据和日志提供者可以存储在同一分区中。例如，假设安装了一块新磁盘，并创建了一个新分区 [.filename]#/dev/ada1p1#。创建日志只需执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:548
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# gjournal label /dev/ada1p1\n"
msgstr "# gjournal label /dev/ada1p1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:554
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The journal size will be 1 GB by default.  You may adjust it by using the `-"
"s` option.  The value can be given in bytes, or appended by `K`, `M` or `G` "
"to denote Kilobytes, Megabytes or Gigabytes respectively.  Note that "
"`gjournal` will not allow you to create unsuitably small journal sizes."
msgstr "默认日志大小为 1 GB。可以使用 `-s` 选项调整大小。值可以用字节表示，也可以在数值后附加 `K`、`M` 或 `G`，分别表示千字节、兆字节或吉字节。请注意，`gjournal` 不允许创建过小的日志。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:556
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, to create a 2 GB journal, you could use the following command:"
msgstr "例如，要创建 2 GB 的日志，可以使用以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:560
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# gjournal label -s 2G /dev/ada1p1\n"
msgstr "# gjournal label -s 2G /dev/ada1p1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:563
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can then initialize a UFS file system on your new partition, enable "
"journaling using `newfs(8)` on the `.journal` device, and disable Soft "
"Updates using `tunefs(8)`:"
msgstr "然后，可以在新分区上初始化 UFS 文件系统，使用 `newfs(8)` 在 `.journal` 设备上启用日志记录，并使用 `tunefs(8)` 禁用 Soft Updates："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:568
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# newfs -J /dev/ada1p1.journal\n"
"# tunefs -n disable -j disable /dev/ada1p1.journal\n"
msgstr "# newfs -J /dev/ada1p1.journal\n# tunefs -n disable -j disable /dev/ada1p1.journal\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:572
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After the file system has been created, it can be mounted normally.  For "
"example, to mount it at `/data`:"
msgstr "创建文件系统后，可以像平常一样挂载。例如，将其挂载到 `/data`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:576
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# mount /dev/ada1p1.journal /data\n"
msgstr "# mount /dev/ada1p1.journal /data\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:579
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To ensure the file system is mounted automatically at boot, add an entry to "
"[.filename]#/etc/fstab#:"
msgstr "要确保文件系统在启动时自动挂载，请在 [.filename]#/etc/fstab# 中添加一条记录："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:583
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "/dev/ada1p1.journal    /data   ufs     rw,async      2       2\n"
msgstr "/dev/ada1p1.journal    /data   ufs     rw,async      2       2\n"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:585
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Notes on Usage"
msgstr "使用注意事项"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:588
#, fuzzy
msgid "When using a single provider for both data and journal storage:"
msgstr "使用同一个提供者同时存储数据和日志时："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:590
#, fuzzy
msgid "The partition must be empty before labeling"
msgstr "标记之前分区必须为空"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:591
#, fuzzy
msgid "The journal space is allocated from within the partition"
msgstr "日志空间从分区内部划分"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:592
#, fuzzy
