#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:594
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Building Journaling into Your Custom Kernel"
msgstr "将日志功能编入自定义内核"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:598
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you do not wish to load `geom_journal` as a module, you can build its "
"functions right into your kernel.  Edit your custom kernel configuration "
"file, and make sure it includes these two lines:"
msgstr "如果不想将 `geom_journal` 作为模块加载，可以将其功能直接编入内核。编辑自定义内核配置文件，并确保其中包含以下两行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:602
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "options UFS_GJOURNAL <1>\n"
msgstr "options UFS_GJOURNAL <1>\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:604
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "options GEOM_JOURNAL <2>\n"
msgstr "options GEOM_JOURNAL <2>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:607
#, fuzzy
msgid "Note: This is already in GENERIC"
msgstr "注意：这已包含在 GENERIC 中"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:608
#, fuzzy
msgid "You will have to add this one"
msgstr "需要添加这一行"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:611
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rebuild and reinstall your kernel following the relevant extref:{handbook}"
"kernelconfig[instructions in the FreeBSD Handbook., kernelconfig]"
msgstr "按照 extref:{handbook}kernelconfig[FreeBSD 手册中的相关说明。, kernelconfig] 重新构建并安装内核"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:613
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Do not forget to remove the relevant \"load\" entry from [.filename]#/boot/"
"loader.conf# if you have previously used it."
msgstr "如果以前使用过，请不要忘记从 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# 中删除相应的 \"load\" 条目。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:614
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Checking GEOM Journaling"
msgstr "检查 GEOM 日志"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:617
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GEOM journaling status can be verified by inspecting active GEOM providers."
msgstr "检查活动的 GEOM 提供者即可验证 GEOM 日志状态。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:619
#, fuzzy
msgid "To list all active GEOM journal devices, run:"
msgstr "要列出所有活动的 GEOM 日志设备，请运行："

#. type: delimited block - 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:623
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# gjournal list\n"
msgstr "# gjournal list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:626
#, fuzzy
msgid "Or to view a summary of journal status:"
msgstr "或者，查看日志状态摘要："

#. type: delimited block - 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:630
