#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/gjournal-desktop/_index.adoc:636
#, fuzzy
msgid "Additional information about GEOM device stacking can be obtained with:"
msgstr "可以使用以下命令获取有关 GEOM 设备堆叠的更多信息："

#. type: delimited block - 4
